"- Review these tips: [Minimize job run time](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"권장 사항\">\n"
"- [워크로드 사용량](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
